            <!-- Cálculo do imposto onward: positionType="Float" only ever pushes an element
                 DOWN past its own hardcoded design Y; it never pulls one UP past that floor
                 when upstream content is absent (confirmed empirically during development —
                 a single Float chain grows fine for N duplicatas but can't shrink to zero for
                 none). Fix: two mutually exclusive copies of this whole block. COPY A keeps
                 the original y (duplicatas present, floats down for 2+ same as always). COPY B
                 uses y shifted up by 24 (label 8 + list 13 + margin 3), reachable only when
                 there are none, sitting right after "Data Saída/Entrada" with no reserved gap. -->
